    3.141592653589793 -> 3.1415926553308964    the nearest multiple of 2^-28: True
   -2.718281828459045 -> -2.718281827867031    the nearest multiple of 2^-28: True
   0.3333333333333333 -> 0.33333333348855376   the nearest multiple of 2^-31: True
                1e-09 -> 9.999999994736442e-10 the nearest multiple of 2^-59: True
float32: BinaryK(K=40, P=30, bias=512) asks for 30 bits of precision, and it is rounded in binary32, which has 24

